WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.667
-Our next guests are nominated
for two Grammys,

00:00:02.667 --> 00:00:04.367
including Best Rock Album.

00:00:04.367 --> 00:00:07.133
Performing "The Wheel"
from their album "Crawler,"

00:00:07.133 --> 00:00:09.133
give it up for Idles.

00:00:09.133 --> 00:00:11.834
