00:00:53.667 --> 00:00:56.334
♪ She said she missed
my brother ♪

00:00:56.334 --> 00:00:59.167
♪ And wanted one more chance ♪

00:00:59.167 --> 00:01:02.267
♪ And so it turns ♪

00:01:02.267 --> 00:01:06.033
♪ Again and again ♪

00:01:06.033 --> 00:01:08.033
